Subject: [PATCH] fix(compat): build Bedrock add-on against StackAnvil
 dependencies

ViaBedrock renamed its protocol constant and removed the experimental feature config switch. Align the downstream add-on with that API so the full stack compiles and embeds the StackAnvil ViaBedrock and CubeConverter artifacts.
